<span class="cs-line"></span>
<span class="cs-line cmt"># Under Optimal Transport (OT) / Rectified Flow:</span>
<span class="cs-line hl-c"># Probability path:   x_t = t * x_1 + (1 - t) * x_0</span>
<span class="cs-line hl-c"># Target velocity:    u_t = x_1 - x_0</span>
