<span class="cs-line cmt"># 1. Continuous Normalizing Flows (2018)</span>
<span class="cs-line cmt"># Loss requires backpropagation through full ODE solver:</span>
<span class="cs-line hl-p"># L_CNF = -log p_0(ODE_solve(x_1, 1 -> 0)) - log_det_jacobian</span>
<span class="cs-line cmt"># (Extremely slow and memory-intensive)</span>
<span class="cs-line"></span>
<span class="cs-line cmt"># 2. Score-Based Diffusion (2020)</span>
<span class="cs-line cmt"># Loss minimizes MSE against the score function:</span>
<span class="cs-line hl-c"># L_Score = E[ || s_theta(x_t, t) - grad_x log p(x_t|x_0) ||^2 ]</span>
<span class="cs-line cmt"># (Stochastic sampling, curved schedules, slow generation)</span>
<span class="cs-line"></span>
<span class="cs-line cmt"># 3. Flow Matching / Rectified Flow (2022)</span>
<span class="cs-line cmt"># Loss minimizes MSE against velocity vectors (no solvers in loop):</span>
<span class="cs-line hl-g"># L_CFM = E[ || v_theta(x_t, t) - (x_1 - x_0) ||^2 ]</span>
